EmitInstrModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Emits a single IR instruction: dispatches the WASM opcode by op, encodes the destination (dst-to-local) and arguments via EmitOperand (for Call — via EmitCallArgs; for IR.ReadFile — path operand directly).
    Provides: EmitInstr(state, ins) -> state. ins — IR instruction map {op, dst, args}; returns state with appended bytes.
    DependsOn: EmitStringInstr, EmitMemInstr, EmitListInstr, EmitMapInstr, EmitBitBox, EmitBitUnbox, EmitCallArgs, EmitOperand, EmitU32LEB, EmitSignedLEB, Push, PushList, IndexOf (tid via tids); reads state["v2l"/"bin"/"un"/"strMap"/"ufi"/"hidx"/"done"/"errOn"/"tbase"/"vbase"/"tids"].
    Composition: Native Include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../EmitInstr/EmitInstr.sir).
    Notes: the IR.Id branch must set LOCAL done=1 (otherwise the call-5 fallback fires — source of silent return corruption). IR.TraceVal branch v2: without flag (state["vbase"]=null) — zero bytes; with flag — emission (header tid/vlen/vtag/vptr plus 2-iovec fd_write fd=3 into 40-byte scratch vbase; tid shared with Trace; vtag — box tag 0-7, vptr — low32 of box address; tag==7 error-arm branching with high bit of vlen, tag==5 null-arm empty, tag<2 render-arm num_to_str #32 via hidx into __traceval__slot, otherwise typed-empty empty — render of int/bool only, null-safe by construction, non-int no longer garbage). IR.Trace branch: without flag (state["tbase"]=null) — zero bytes; with flag — emission (i32.const tb/tid, iovec into scratch, fd_write fd=3, drop; tid via IndexOf plus append; path validated as kind const/ref plus str plus length 1..120, charset — documented limitation). IR.Call resolves the name: ufi[name], on miss — state["hidx"] (canonical helper indexes 4..49 at N_IMPORTS=4; #47–49 — sir_le/sir_ge/sir_ne). Double miss (neither in ufi nor hidx) — loud: poison call 999999, validator fails out of bounds. Binary ops via binMap: after the sir_div/sir_mod call (IR.Div/IR.Mod) a tag err-check is inserted branching to __err__. IR.ReadFile: ref path emitted as an operand, string literal — materialized from the data region (strMap + sir_const_str #24) straight onto the stack before call sir_read_file #43; after the call — tag err-check. String emission factored into EmitStringInstr Central instruction-encoding dispatcher.
